er and the iterator after it, `error` with the iterator after the\nill-formed input, or `done` at the end of the input.","docLink":"./UnicodeFormat/Iterator/EncodingScheme.html#Unicode.EncodingScheme.decodeChar","kind":"def","line":77,"name":"Unicode.EncodingScheme.decodeChar","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-unicode-format/blob/929442f07486b2652bf358c2afa06a276eaab7cd/UnicodeFormat/Iterator/EncodingScheme.lean#L77-L94"}}],"imports":["Init","UnicodeFormat.EncodingScheme","UnicodeFormat.Iterator.Bytes"],"instances":[{"className":"Unicode.Decoder","name":"Unicode.instDecoderEncodingSchemeUInt8Char","typeNames":["Unicode.EncodingScheme","UInt8","Char"]},{"className":"Unicode.Encoder","name":"Unicode.instEncoderEncodingSchemeCharUInt8","typeNames":["Unicode.EncodingScheme","Char","UInt8"]}],"name":"UnicodeFormat.Iterator.EncodingScheme"}